OL,3,ASouth Africa's Ramaphosa wins court
OL,4,Abattle over impeachment threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth African President Cyril Ramaphosa
OL,7,Fhas won a legal battle to overturn a
OL,8,Freport that found he may have a case to
OL,9,Fanswer over the theft of large sums of
OL,10,Fcash from his private farm.
OL,12,FIn 2022, an independent panel said
OL,13,FRamaphosa may have committed serious
OL,14,Fmisconduct relating to the theft of
OL,15,F$580,000 (#443,000), hidden in a sofa,
OL,16,Fat his Phala Phala game farm in the
OL,17,FLimpopo province. He denied any
OL,18,Fwrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
