OL,3,ASouth Africa's Ramaphosa wins court
OL,4,Abattle over impeachment threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FRamaphosa challenged the findings of
OL,7,Fthe report in court after the
OL,8,FConstitutional Court ruled that
OL,9,Fparliament had violated the
OL,10,Fconstitution by blocking moves to
OL,11,Fimpeach him.
OL,13,FThe Western Cape high court ruled that
OL,14,Fthe panel's report was unlawful and set
OL,15,Fit aside "in its entirety".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
